READING: if EVERY non-AP family (incl. high-height + CRT-lifts + mod-25 blockers) clears at
some bounded q (<=39, ideally <=14), the (C) covering is height-uniform -- the open node holds.
A single covering GAP would refute kps S44's finite covering. The max clearing-q is the mechanism.
